WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Our message is very simple.

00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.320
If you come illegally into the United States,

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.700
you're going to jail,

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.200
or you're going back to where you came from,

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.160
or perhaps even further than that.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:11.920
You know what that means.

